ast instead of what actually happened.","stage":"stage_c_lite","suite":"shapes","a":"kd_mix_m_300k","b":"gt_mix_m_300k","ratio":[0.8517908711691343,0.8189187215422689,0.8843514961963355]},{"title":"Random noise teaches nothing","versus":"than structured synthetic inputs","text":"The teacher answers every noise input the same way, so the student learns one flat forecast. Structured synthetic series work.","stage":"stage_a","suite":"shapes","a":"kd_noise","b":"kd_synth","ratio":[5.698063269098726,4.862364523094823,6.665776941098844]},{"title":"More data is the biggest lever","versus":"than 30k windows","text":"300k training windows instead of 30k, same student. No other change we tried moved the score as much.","stage":"stage_c_lite","suite":"shapes","a":"kd_mix_m_300k","b":"kd_mix_m_30k","ratio":[0.7417383829177293,0.7025984706177503,0.7796008189041391]},{"title":"And it keeps paying off","versus":"than 300k windows","text":"1M windows from about 40 datasets instead of 300k, same student. Measured on the fresh French electricity test, whose series were never in training.","stage":"stage_c2","suite":"fresh_fr_power","a":"kd_v2_1m","b":"kd_v2_300k","ratio":[0.8935657073424772,0.8700958577881337,0.9158916903002952]},{"title":"Which teacher you pick matters little","versus":"than Timestral alone","text":"Averaging three teachers (Timestral, Toto, t0) beats Timestral alone, but only by about 2%.","stage":"stage_b","suite":"multidomain_test","a":"kd_ensemble","b":"kd_timestral","ratio":[0.9801428855477637,0.9709793254515726,0.989242284905367]},{"title":"Little data? Start from the distilled student","versus":"than starting from random weights","text":"Fine-tuning on one week of electricity history (3 seeds): from random weights it does worse than naive; from the distilled student it keeps its zero-shot accuracy.","stage":"stage_d_final","suite":"fresh_fr_power","a":"ft_warm_fr_1w_distilled","b":"ft_warm_fr_1w_scratch","ratio":[0.5374458357153759,0.5100766142339969,0.5637627241421788]},{"title":"One month of teacher labels \u2248 one year of real data","versus":"than 12 months of real values","text":"Fine-tuning on the teacher's forecasts of 1 month of history scores like fine-tuning on 12 months of real values.","stage":"stage_e","suite":"fresh_fr_power","a":"kd_fr_1m","b":"gt_fr_1y","ratio":[1.0272807432595998,0.9989436909121889,1.0565418567683527]},{"title":"With a full year of data, the head start is gone","versus":"than starting from random weights","text":"Honest limit: with enough history, training from scratch is as good or slightly better.","stage":"stage_d_final","suite":"fresh_fr_power","a":"ft_warm_fr_1y_distilled","b":"ft_warm_fr_1y_scratch","ratio":[1.0421117007892169,1.0145515580493103,1.0718193578348656]}]}